WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.110
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.380 --> 00:07.100
[The content, events, techniques, and outcomes of massage depicted in this series]

3
00:07.210 --> 00:08.211
[are entirely fictional and intended for entertainment purposes only.]

4
00:08.240 --> 00:09.421
[They should not be used as medical advice or as a reference for traditional Thai massage.]

5
00:09.500 --> 00:10.901
[Viewer discretion is advised. Do not attempt to imitate any of the techniques shown,]

6
00:11.000 --> 00:12.001
[as doing so may result in injury.]

7
00:12.030 --> 00:13.161
[Massage services should only be provided by practitioners]

8
00:13.170 --> 00:14.800
[who are legally licensed and registered.]

9
00:14.870 --> 00:17.840
Are you sure Phat is helping you out of the goodness of his heart?

10
00:17.871 --> 00:21.440
Think about why he killed Dongyang and is still alive…Master Tim.

11
00:22.712 --> 00:26.360
Police Colonel Krit Teeranasakul.

12
00:27.827 --> 00:28.828
Hattha.

13
00:32.430 --> 00:34.400
I'm sorry to bother you at home, sir.

14
00:34.431 --> 00:36.800
My father, Uncle Doctor In, and the caregiver

15
00:36.832 --> 00:38.760
have been kidnapped by Master Tim and taken to Arokaya.

16
00:38.810 --> 00:40.080
Please help me, sir.

17
00:40.100 --> 00:42.720
I think Master Tim knows the people who attacked my family in Phuket.

18
00:42.744 --> 00:46.440
And do you still have any evidence from that case?

19
00:46.656 --> 00:49.000
- Yes, I do. - Let's go right away.

20
00:49.057 --> 00:50.700
So we can get this whole thing sorted out.

21
00:51.792 --> 00:54.400
- Don't worry. I'll have the housekeeper take care of it. - It's okay.

22
00:54.539 --> 00:55.811
- I can clean it. - No, it's fine.

23
00:55.848 --> 00:56.849
You're Flatfoot!

24
01:00.446 --> 01:02.760
You're Flatfoot! You killed my mom!

25
01:03.880 --> 01:04.881
Hey! What are you doing?

26
01:06.081 --> 01:07.082
Stop!

27
01:07.091 --> 01:09.040
I've been waiting for you to finally figure it out.

28
02:09.352 --> 02:10.353
You...

29
02:21.664 --> 02:23.440
You worthless parasites

30
02:23.899 --> 02:26.720
have been getting in the way of my business for far too long.

31
02:42.094 --> 02:43.095
Dad.

32
02:47.590 --> 02:48.591
Don't!

33
02:52.608 --> 02:54.440
Hey, wait!

34
02:54.920 --> 02:57.280
You killed Dongyang because of this bitch, didn't you?

35
02:57.862 --> 03:01.520
You didn't kill him for me. You killed Dongyang for her!

36
03:02.934 --> 03:03.935
- Dad! - Hey!

37
03:03.960 --> 03:04.961
Just let her go.

38
03:05.579 --> 03:07.000
Dad, I'm begging you.

39
03:08.900 --> 03:09.920
You're in love with her, aren't you?

40
03:12.736 --> 03:14.480
Can a hitman like you even love someone?

41
03:15.437 --> 03:16.438
Huh?

42
03:16.571 --> 03:19.472
Have you ever asked her if she loves you back?

43
03:20.992 --> 03:22.880
I'd like to know if she'd still love you

44
03:23.227 --> 03:24.700
if she found out your father killed her mother.

45
03:26.448 --> 03:27.449
Would she still love you then?

46
03:30.550 --> 03:31.680
You're such a fool.

47
03:33.904 --> 03:35.520
Just as stupid as your mother.

48
03:38.728 --> 03:40.729
What am I supposed to do with you, Phat? Huh?

49
03:41.566 --> 03:43.920
What kind of son are you? You're nothing like me!

50
03:57.534 --> 03:58.535
Dad.

51
04:00.211 --> 04:01.412
Please, Dad. I'm begging you.

52
04:05.854 --> 04:06.920
I love Hattha.

53
04:09.960 --> 04:10.961
Please let her go.

54
04:12.900 --> 04:13.901
So tell me,

55
04:14.163 --> 04:17.320
are you supposed to obey my orders, or am I supposed to obey yours?

56
04:18.158 --> 04:19.159
Huh?

57
04:20.159 --> 04:21.160
Answer me!

58
04:22.550 --> 04:23.551
Answer me!

59
04:26.262 --> 04:27.680
Whatever you want me to do, Dad,

60
04:29.800 --> 04:31.120
I'll do anything for you.

61
04:34.400 --> 04:35.920
All I ask is that you let me have her.

62
04:36.107 --> 04:37.108
I won't allow it!

63
04:38.955 --> 04:40.200
And right now,

64
04:41.880 --> 04:43.200
I'm ordering you to kill her!

65
04:44.694 --> 04:46.000
- Dad! - Kill that bitch right now!

66
04:46.045 --> 04:47.650
- Dad, I'm begging you! - Now!

67
04:55.507 --> 04:56.508
Dad!

68
04:58.819 --> 04:59.960
Please, Dad. I'm begging you.

69
05:00.398 --> 05:01.560
If you won't do it,

70
05:02.574 --> 05:03.720
I'll kill her myself!

71
05:06.360 --> 05:07.361
Dad!

72
05:30.851 --> 05:32.200
Hey, Phat!

73
05:36.963 --> 05:38.040
- Phat! - Go!

74
05:38.088 --> 05:39.089
- Phat! - Go!

75
05:41.742 --> 05:42.743
Phat!

76
05:44.355 --> 05:45.356
Phat!

77
05:45.736 --> 05:46.800
You son of a bitch!

78
05:50.198 --> 05:51.199
Hop on!

79
05:52.984 --> 05:53.985
Phat!

80
06:26.379 --> 06:27.380
Stop!

81
06:28.283 --> 06:29.284
Stop!

82
06:34.382 --> 06:35.383
Hattha.

83
06:36.094 --> 06:37.095
Hattha.

84
06:37.752 --> 06:38.753
Hattha.

85
06:40.147 --> 06:41.680
I'm sorry I didn't tell you.

86
06:42.390 --> 06:44.840
You knew all along that your father killed my mother, didn't you?

87
06:45.872 --> 06:46.880
You were trying to deceive me!

88
06:46.960 --> 06:47.961
No, Hattha.

89
06:48.166 --> 06:50.080
Hattha, I wasn't lying to you.

90
06:50.310 --> 06:52.920
And I only recently found out he was the man you wanted to kill.

91
06:53.464 --> 06:55.040
You told me to stay away from that flatfoot bastard.

92
06:55.065 --> 06:56.700
And go back home to my father in Photharam.

93
06:56.720 --> 06:58.880
- You were trying to protect your father! - Was I protecting him back there?

94
07:02.867 --> 07:04.050
I know you're angry with me.

95
07:05.304 --> 07:06.840
But I can't change the fact that I'm his son.

96
07:12.462 --> 07:13.520
Then stay away from me!

97
07:13.848 --> 07:14.849
Hattha.

98
07:14.851 --> 07:16.400
- What can I do to make you trust me? - Let go of me!

99
07:16.755 --> 07:17.756
Hattha.

100
07:19.294 --> 07:20.960
Trying to help your father

101
07:21.480 --> 07:23.200
and kill him is far too dangerous.

102
07:23.379 --> 07:25.520
- Stay out of it! - You can't do this alone, understand?

103
07:27.363 --> 07:29.280
My father has planted someone inside Arokaya.

104
07:29.592 --> 07:31.832
You'll get caught before you even reach him.

105
07:32.480 --> 07:33.481
I told you to stay out of it!

106
07:34.560 --> 07:36.296
Hattha! Hattha!

107
07:37.139 --> 07:38.160
If you don't trust me,

108
07:39.200 --> 07:40.201
then shoot me.

109
09:59.499 --> 10:00.500
Hello!

110
10:00.520 --> 10:01.521
- Hello! - Where's Hattha?

111
10:02.182 --> 10:03.240
- Hattha! - Wan!

112
10:05.072 --> 10:07.240
What? Mr. Krit did this to you?

113
10:08.273 --> 10:09.274
How did you know, Wan?

114
10:09.531 --> 10:12.400
Phat called and told me you'd snuck into Mr. Krit's house.

115
10:12.736 --> 10:14.237
Thank goodness he got you out of there.

116
10:14.700 --> 10:16.800
Did he also tell you how he managed to get in and out?

117
10:16.810 --> 10:17.811
Because it's his father's house.

118
10:18.480 --> 10:19.481
What?

119
10:20.160 --> 10:21.161
Phat is Mr. Krit's son?

120
10:22.411 --> 10:24.040
No wonder nobody can touch him.

121
10:24.950 --> 10:26.151
Even after he killed Dongyang.

122
10:28.150 --> 10:30.800
No wonder Phat always seemed so mysterious.

123
10:31.019 --> 10:32.600
He barely talks to anyone.

124
10:33.070 --> 10:35.000
When I saw him getting close to Hattha,

125
10:35.071 --> 10:37.280
I wondered when they had become so close.

126
10:40.072 --> 10:41.400
It was probably because of his father's orders.

127
10:42.678 --> 10:43.680
What does Mr. Krit have to do with this?

128
10:44.558 --> 10:46.120
This morning, I went there to find out

129
10:47.159 --> 10:49.500
if he really had a scar on his foot. And he did!

130
10:51.491 --> 10:53.120
Mr. Krit is that flatfoot bastard who killed my mother.

131
10:55.483 --> 10:58.520
I never imagined Mr. Krit could be so evil.

132
10:59.344 --> 11:01.280
He looks so respectable in this picture.

133
11:01.590 --> 11:04.680
I was even thinking that if he became the party leader,

134
11:04.880 --> 11:07.100
I'd vote for him as prime minister in the next election.

135
11:09.243 --> 11:10.744
Like father, like son. They're both good at putting on an act.

136
11:14.291 --> 11:15.292
They're despicable!

137
11:38.150 --> 11:39.151
Master Tim!

138
11:39.654 --> 11:40.655
Master Tim!

139
11:41.900 --> 11:42.901
What are you doing?

140
11:47.401 --> 11:48.960
Why didn't you kill that bastard Korn?

141
11:49.611 --> 11:50.612
Why the hell did you let him live?

142
11:50.891 --> 11:51.892
Don't worry.

143
11:52.880 --> 11:54.700
I won't let him cause you any trouble, sir.

144
11:55.451 --> 11:56.452
Goddamn it!

145
11:56.883 --> 11:59.720
You knew he was still alive, but you deliberately kept it from me!

146
12:00.243 --> 12:02.035
How the hell am I supposed to trust you anymore?

147
12:02.360 --> 12:04.542
Can we discuss this like civilized people?

148
12:04.595 --> 12:05.596
Fine.

149
12:09.768 --> 12:11.600
Why did you capture those bastards?

150
12:12.238 --> 12:13.239
What do you want?

151
12:14.526 --> 12:16.700
Korn and I studied massage therapy together.

152
12:19.979 --> 12:23.400
I once asked him to help me develop a massage technique that could kill.

153
12:23.926 --> 12:24.927
A deadly massage technique?

154
12:28.694 --> 12:31.080
What the hell? Like in those Chinese martial arts movies?

155
12:32.790 --> 12:35.160
That's fucking ridiculous!

156
12:36.694 --> 12:39.200
Moo, take me to those bastards!

157
12:46.174 --> 12:47.715
If you do anything to them, sir,

158
12:48.110 --> 12:50.440
the upcoming party leadership election will be in jeopardy.

159
12:51.672 --> 12:55.760
But if those bastards are still alive and expose me, it'll be just as bad!

160
12:56.451 --> 12:58.200
We each have our own goals.

161
12:59.998 --> 13:01.840
The prime minister position you're after

162
13:02.312 --> 13:04.640
is no different from my desire to find Korn.

163
13:05.235 --> 13:06.760
Once I become prime minister,

164
13:07.139 --> 13:10.760
I can call black white, and no one will dare contradict me.

165
13:11.267 --> 13:13.000
And you'll benefit from that, too.

166
13:13.822 --> 13:16.062
If I get the deadly massage manual from Korn,

167
13:17.659 --> 13:21.080
I can help you eliminate your political rivals.

168
13:22.000 --> 13:23.401
And becoming prime minister

169
13:23.942 --> 13:25.200
will be much easier for you.

170
13:29.323 --> 13:30.324
Fine.

171
13:31.259 --> 13:34.520
I'll give you until the party leadership election. No longer.

172
13:35.760 --> 13:39.320
And once that day comes, I won't let any fucking bastard stand in my way!

173
13:42.907 --> 13:45.008
Whatever you're planning, you'd better hurry.

174
13:46.443 --> 13:48.400
His daughter looks like she's not one to mess with.

175
13:49.256 --> 13:50.920
She'll be coming to rescue her father soon.

176
13:54.776 --> 13:56.250
I'll be waiting for her.

177
13:58.755 --> 13:59.756
Call Muk.

178
14:00.648 --> 14:02.160
Ask if Korn has been acting suspiciously.

179
14:03.763 --> 14:05.040
Muk isn't keeping an eye on him, sir.

180
14:07.971 --> 14:08.972
Where did Muk go?

181
14:09.198 --> 14:11.399
Called in sick. Said he had a doctor's appointment.

182
14:20.694 --> 14:22.720
Arokaya is actually a gambling den?

183
14:25.622 --> 14:27.320
Is there any way we can expose them?

184
14:27.440 --> 14:29.720
Like sneaking in, filming them, and posting it on social media?

185
14:29.782 --> 14:33.000
Then people online could pressure the authorities to investigate Arokaya.

186
14:33.622 --> 14:36.200
Or should we approach Mr. Krit's political rivals

187
14:36.822 --> 14:38.240
and get them to do something about it?

188
14:42.382 --> 14:45.440
Wan, now I'm jealous!

189
14:46.000 --> 14:48.101
You invited a girl over here?

190
15:00.214 --> 15:01.215
You don't have to leave.

191
15:04.608 --> 15:05.760
I won't tell Master Tim.

192
15:09.280 --> 15:10.281
I came alone.

193
15:12.291 --> 15:14.000
Master Tim doesn't know I came to see you.

194
15:15.539 --> 15:18.360
I told Muk to let me know if anything happened.

195
15:21.630 --> 15:24.680
If I help you find your father and bring him back,

196
15:28.094 --> 15:29.320
will you help me?

197
15:32.104 --> 15:33.105
What do you need help with?

198
15:41.776 --> 15:43.400
I'll go get some first-aid supplies for you.

199
15:51.766 --> 15:53.960
Master Tim is obsessed with the deadly massage technique.

200
15:55.584 --> 15:57.574
At first, he wasn't even sure it existed.

201
15:59.630 --> 16:00.920
So he just...

202
16:02.531 --> 16:03.960
kept searching for it.

203
16:06.926 --> 16:08.440
But once he heard about it from you,

204
16:11.523 --> 16:12.840
he became even more violent.

205
16:19.854 --> 16:21.300
Then why do you put up with it?

206
16:29.720 --> 16:31.360
Master Tim took me in off the streets.

207
16:33.331 --> 16:35.200
I look up to him like a father.

208
16:36.910 --> 16:38.814
No child would dare speak up

209
16:40.739 --> 16:42.440
about what their father has done to them.

210
16:46.904 --> 16:50.880
I know that if I keep putting up with this,

211
16:53.323 --> 16:55.320
I'll end up as nothing more than a practice dummy for his deadly massage technique.

212
16:58.955 --> 16:59.956
I'm scared.

213
17:11.099 --> 17:12.100
Stay with me.

214
17:12.790 --> 17:13.840
You don't have to go back.

215
17:14.592 --> 17:15.640
But Master Tim...

216
17:17.462 --> 17:18.700
You've already endured enough

217
17:20.680 --> 17:22.300
to repay everything he's done for you.

218
17:24.662 --> 17:26.160
If you want me to help you,

219
17:27.520 --> 17:29.300
you have to learn to love yourself first.

220
18:16.304 --> 18:18.000
This is an old ice factory owned by my father's friend.

221
18:18.760 --> 18:20.280
Hattha and I have been hiding out here.

222
18:20.561 --> 18:23.640
It's close to home, and Master Tim would never think to look here.

223
18:25.264 --> 18:28.400
I ran away from Master Tim.

224
18:28.784 --> 18:30.470
I didn't bring anything with me.

225
18:30.950 --> 18:33.500
I was afraid he'd find out.

226
18:33.707 --> 18:36.400
It's okay. You can use my things for now.

227
18:36.410 --> 18:37.411
You can borrow my clothes, too.

228
18:38.251 --> 18:40.280
Then I'll take you shopping for essentials tomorrow.

229
18:42.640 --> 18:44.000
- Are you hungry? - Yes.

230
18:47.464 --> 18:49.880
I'll go see what we have in the kitchen.

231
18:52.208 --> 18:53.209
After you.

232
19:12.038 --> 19:13.100
Would you like some sausages?

233
19:13.811 --> 19:14.812
Let's add some sausages.

234
19:16.760 --> 19:18.761
(Master Tim)

235
19:28.936 --> 19:29.937
It's Master Tim.

236
19:31.752 --> 19:33.840
He probably knows by now that I've run away.

237
19:34.664 --> 19:35.760
Actually, I'm glad he found out.

238
19:36.024 --> 19:38.952
He needs to know he's not God and can't control everyone's life.

239
19:43.806 --> 19:45.840
So what's your plan

240
19:46.302 --> 19:48.000
to rescue your father?

241
19:49.235 --> 19:50.720
Master Tim knows you're coming.

242
19:51.134 --> 19:52.776
He's already prepared for your arrival.

243
19:53.475 --> 19:54.720
We're still figuring it out.

244
19:55.752 --> 19:58.750
But Ya said the VIP floor is guarded and covered by CCTV cameras.

245
19:59.150 --> 20:02.360
Phat could handle all those guards on his own.

246
20:07.782 --> 20:09.300
We're doing this without him.

247
20:18.819 --> 20:21.120
I don't know what happened between you two,

248
20:22.371 --> 20:25.640
but if you're planning to sneak into Arokaya and rescue someone,

249
20:26.619 --> 20:28.160
you'll definitely need his help.

250
21:04.966 --> 21:06.250
Hello? I need a favor.

251
21:09.291 --> 21:10.292
Hello?

252
21:26.990 --> 21:27.991
What do you need?

253
21:28.536 --> 21:29.560
It's about your father, isn't it?

254
21:31.251 --> 21:32.880
If you're uncomfortable helping, you don't have to.

255
21:33.528 --> 21:35.000
Did I say I was uncomfortable?

256
21:38.216 --> 21:39.217
Let's talk at home.

257
21:41.747 --> 21:42.748
Hop on.

258
22:21.672 --> 22:22.673
Thank you.

259
22:29.475 --> 22:32.902
By the time you sneak in, get the footage, and post it online,

260
22:33.104 --> 22:35.640
it'll take days for the public pressure to build up.

261
22:36.363 --> 22:37.600
Are you afraid I'll expose your father?

262
22:38.112 --> 22:39.113
Hattha.

263
22:40.363 --> 22:42.364
If I were, I wouldn't be sitting here.

264
22:43.894 --> 22:45.400
Then what's the plan?

265
22:46.550 --> 22:48.880
If we can't get in, we'll have to lure them out.

266
22:49.515 --> 22:51.960
Arokaya's alarm system is extremely sensitive.

267
22:52.440 --> 22:55.680
If we trigger the smoke detectors,

268
22:55.800 --> 22:57.500
the alarm will go off.

269
22:57.982 --> 23:00.040
All the automatic doors will open.

270
23:00.462 --> 23:02.600
Everyone will panic, including the people in the gambling den.

271
23:02.998 --> 23:05.480
Anyone carrying chips, cash, or guns

272
23:06.040 --> 23:07.041
will be exposed.

273
23:08.720 --> 23:10.960
Then we'll use the chaos

274
23:11.254 --> 23:12.600
to rescue your father.

275
23:13.582 --> 23:16.183
If the plan fails, they might move your father somewhere else.

276
23:16.203 --> 23:17.524
Do you really think I'm that stupid?

277
23:17.763 --> 23:18.764
Hattha.

278
23:19.987 --> 23:21.700
Phat's only warning you because he's worried about you.

279
23:22.403 --> 23:24.800
If Master Tim moves our father somewhere else,

280
23:25.128 --> 23:26.480
it'll be even harder for us to rescue him.

281
23:27.294 --> 23:29.180
We might not even get a second chance.

282
23:32.771 --> 23:35.550
We can't work together if you still don't trust me.

283
23:45.011 --> 23:46.240
Can I talk to you for a minute?

284
24:15.174 --> 24:17.800
I only found out my father killed your mother when you told me.

285
24:28.854 --> 24:30.520
This is grown-up business. Go to bed.

286
24:43.427 --> 24:44.920
And everything I've done

287
24:45.792 --> 24:48.000
was because I wanted to make it up to you on his behalf.

288
24:50.283 --> 24:51.284
So you're finally admitting it?

289
24:57.419 --> 24:59.560
I just want to feel less guilty about my father.

290
25:02.368 --> 25:03.369
Guilty about what?

291
25:10.187 --> 25:11.250
My father and I

292
25:13.856 --> 25:14.960
were never close.

293
25:17.835 --> 25:18.840
When I was little,

294
25:19.846 --> 25:22.840
he wouldn't let my mother and me move to Phuket to live with him.

295
25:24.038 --> 25:27.280
He said he was worried about our safety.

296
25:29.136 --> 25:31.040
Until my eighth birthday,

297
25:31.867 --> 25:33.800
when my mother took me to Phuket to surprise him.

298
25:37.392 --> 25:38.393
Uh... Phat.

299
25:41.500 --> 25:42.501
Hi.

300
25:45.416 --> 25:46.880
Well? Are you surprised?

301
25:47.560 --> 25:48.640
Yes, I am.

302
25:48.974 --> 25:52.360
Happy birthday to you.

303
25:52.840 --> 25:56.000
Happy birthday to you.

304
25:56.576 --> 26:00.600
Happy birthday, happy birthday.

305
26:00.654 --> 26:04.640
Happy birthday to you.

306
26:20.640 --> 26:21.960
[Marriage Certificate]

307
26:30.430 --> 26:32.979
- Dad... Dad, come here! - Dad, don't go!

308
26:33.646 --> 26:34.647
Dad!

309
26:35.512 --> 26:38.560
Come on, don't hit him. Stop it, son.

310
26:41.200 --> 26:42.201
Phat!

311
26:43.886 --> 26:44.887
Are you okay?

312
26:47.998 --> 26:48.999
We'll talk later.

313
27:15.390 --> 27:17.720
Hey, have you seen my money? It blew this way.

314
27:18.232 --> 27:19.233
No, I haven't.

315
27:24.520 --> 27:26.160
That was the day we met on the beach.

316
27:30.403 --> 27:33.000
I'm sorry, but how did your mother get into a car accident?

317
27:34.982 --> 27:37.520
When I found out the truth about my father,

318
27:41.280 --> 27:42.650
I was angry at everyone in the world.

319
27:45.352 --> 27:47.880
And I wanted them to know how much I was hurting.

320
27:51.475 --> 27:53.200
So I stole my mother's money and ran away.

321
28:03.310 --> 28:05.760
She went looking for me and got into an accident.

322
28:20.776 --> 28:21.777
After that,

323
28:23.520 --> 28:26.221
my father sent me to live with my uncle, who worked as his hitman.

324
28:33.300 --> 28:34.301
What about Dad?

325
28:34.760 --> 28:35.960
Just stay here with me.

326
28:36.419 --> 28:38.460
Behave yourself, and maybe your dad will love you.

327
28:42.611 --> 28:43.612
He was sick.

328
28:43.723 --> 28:45.640
And he knew he didn't have much time left.

329
28:47.520 --> 28:50.360
So he raised me to take his place.

330
28:51.926 --> 28:52.927
Harder!

331
28:54.000 --> 28:55.001
Yeah!

332
28:55.851 --> 28:58.300
Come on! I said harder! Faster!

333
28:58.406 --> 29:00.600
Good! Faster! Keep going!

334
29:01.494 --> 29:02.495
Faster!

335
29:04.107 --> 29:05.108
Come on!

336
29:08.000 --> 29:09.840
I grew up feeling guilty

337
29:13.664 --> 29:14.920
for causing my mother's death.

338
29:21.038 --> 29:23.039
And my uncle kept telling me every day

339
29:33.118 --> 29:35.480
that if I wanted my father to love me, I had to obey him.

340
29:42.950 --> 29:45.240
And there were my mother's last words to me.

341
29:46.846 --> 29:48.680
My son, Patrick.

342
29:49.774 --> 29:50.880
Stay with Dad.

343
29:51.768 --> 29:53.350
Listen to him.

344
29:58.230 --> 29:59.231
Mom!

345
29:59.696 --> 30:00.697
Mom!

346
30:08.422 --> 30:09.723
I'm so sorry for your loss.

347
30:11.488 --> 30:12.689
Mom!

348
30:13.560 --> 30:14.640
Mom!

349
30:15.598 --> 30:16.824
Mom!

350
30:17.854 --> 30:19.300
Your mother was worried about you.

351
30:21.363 --> 30:23.300
That's why she drove out to look for you.

352
30:25.486 --> 30:26.560
Otherwise, she'd still be...

353
30:27.630 --> 30:30.280
Dad, I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

354
30:31.731 --> 30:32.732
Hey!

355
30:43.048 --> 30:44.649
I knew what I was doing was wrong.

356
30:46.608 --> 30:47.880
But I didn't care.

357
30:49.936 --> 30:51.560
Because the only thing I wanted

358
30:52.700 --> 30:54.701
was for my father to forgive me.

359
30:58.206 --> 31:00.520
So I did everything he told me to do.

360
31:12.496 --> 31:13.700
Until I met you.

361
31:19.494 --> 31:21.080
I'm not that important.

362
31:24.406 --> 31:25.407
Yes, you are.

363
31:29.224 --> 31:30.800
I kept the truth about my father from you,

364
31:33.700 --> 31:35.320
but I never lied to you.

365
31:40.195 --> 31:42.240
And the reason I wanted you to give up your revenge

366
31:45.272 --> 31:47.600
was because I genuinely wanted you to go back to your father.

367
31:52.019 --> 31:54.360
You still have a father waiting to hold you in his arms.

368
31:58.867 --> 31:59.880
But I don't.

369
32:02.750 --> 32:05.440
And I don't even know if I'll ever have that before I die.

370
32:12.728 --> 32:13.729
I'm sorry.

371
32:25.302 --> 32:26.930
My father has never forgiven me.

372
32:32.339 --> 32:34.000
But you'll forgive me, won't you?

373
32:54.598 --> 32:55.880
I'm ordering you to kill her!

374
32:56.896 --> 32:58.340
And you're going to do it right now!

375
32:59.024 --> 33:00.400
Kill that bitch right now!

376
33:20.832 --> 33:21.960
If you won't do it,

377
33:22.939 --> 33:24.120
I'll kill her myself!

378
33:27.664 --> 33:28.800
Please, Dad. I'm begging you.

379
33:33.227 --> 33:34.320
I love Hattha.

380
33:38.182 --> 33:39.183
Leave her alone.

381
34:56.120 --> 34:57.720
[Teeranasakul Residence]

382
35:04.397 --> 35:07.520
Yesterday, Mr. Narong played golf with Secretary Chukiat.

383
35:12.102 --> 35:13.440
So that means

384
35:15.275 --> 35:17.100
Chukiat has already picked a side.

385
35:17.926 --> 35:19.300
What does Narong's team have to say?

386
35:20.160 --> 35:22.080
They're digging up information on you, sir.

387
35:22.771 --> 35:24.595
But we've already taken precautions.

388
35:24.798 --> 35:25.840
I assure you,

389
35:25.971 --> 35:28.480
nothing they could use against you

390
35:28.678 --> 35:29.920
will ever get leaked.

391
35:37.926 --> 35:38.927
You never know.

392
35:41.968 --> 35:43.920
I'm going to elevate traditional Thai healing

393
35:44.592 --> 35:47.600
into a premium wellness identity.

394
35:49.062 --> 35:53.120
It's an intellectual legacy passed down from our ancestors.

395
35:54.120 --> 35:56.221
And I'll make sure it earns a place on the world stage.

396
35:58.083 --> 35:59.800
- Do you know how I'm going to do that? - How, sir?

397
36:00.952 --> 36:03.360
By looking beyond just tourists.

398
36:04.840 --> 36:07.720
I'm targeting multinational corporations.

399
36:09.000 --> 36:11.760
Because they have enormous purchasing power.

400
36:12.387 --> 36:14.595
And that enormous purchasing power

401
36:15.064 --> 36:18.880
will also help boost Thailand's grassroots economy

402
36:19.200 --> 36:21.960
to new heights.

403
36:30.550 --> 36:34.480
Hey, everyone! Today, I am taking you to check out a chic new spot!

404
36:34.619 --> 36:37.360
And the atmosphere here is amazing, everyone!

405
36:37.398 --> 36:39.080
- Exactly! - It's gorgeous!

406
36:39.472 --> 36:41.600
Welcome to Arokaya Land!

407
36:44.670 --> 36:46.640
I'm telling you, everyone,

408
36:46.671 --> 36:48.760
this place is huge and absolutely stunning!

409
36:48.814 --> 36:50.880
And it's got everything you could possibly need.

410
36:50.900 --> 36:54.240
From a movie theater to cafés, they've got it all!

411
36:54.371 --> 36:57.080
And if you love massages, you're in for a treat!

412
36:57.102 --> 37:00.080
- Because massages are their specialty here! - Let's go!

413
37:00.470 --> 37:01.471
Come on!

414
37:33.182 --> 37:37.000
And this is Master Tim, an expert in traditional Thai massage.

415
37:37.053 --> 37:39.523
He's the man behind Arokaya Land.

416
37:39.592 --> 37:42.440
First of all, we'd like to thank Master Tim

417
37:42.450 --> 37:44.400
for taking the time to speak with us today.

418
37:44.451 --> 37:45.840
Thank you.

419
37:47.075 --> 37:48.076
Okay.

420
37:49.368 --> 37:50.600
Thank you, Master Tim.

421
37:50.931 --> 37:54.120
I'll send you the video as soon as we've finished editing it.

422
37:54.526 --> 37:58.050
But I haven't been able to reach your assistant, Muk.

423
37:58.493 --> 37:59.800
Who should I contact instead?

424
38:00.830 --> 38:02.920
I'll have someone else get in touch with you.

425
38:03.680 --> 38:04.681
Muk is on sick leave.

426
38:04.769 --> 38:06.320
Oh, I see.

427
38:50.152 --> 38:52.132
- Found anything yet? - Not yet, Master Tim.

428
39:13.800 --> 39:15.571
The smoke detector has been triggered, Master Tim.

429
39:15.801 --> 39:16.802
But we haven't found the source yet.

430
39:19.632 --> 39:20.720
They're here.

431
39:26.086 --> 39:27.808
Oh my God, there's a fire! Let's get out of here!

432
39:28.198 --> 39:30.360
Wait! My livestream views are skyrocketing!

433
39:30.416 --> 39:32.350
Who cares? Let's get out of here! Hurry!

434
39:49.656 --> 39:50.657
Hey! Stop filming!

435
39:50.700 --> 39:52.000
Look! What are those chips?

436
39:52.840 --> 39:55.041
Everyone, are you seeing what I'm seeing?

437
40:15.014 --> 40:16.615
Shit! What if Master Tim has already moved our fathers?

438
40:17.406 --> 40:18.920
Maybe he took them through the VIP exit.

439
40:24.451 --> 40:25.452
Come here!

440
40:27.784 --> 40:28.785
Get in!

441
40:37.048 --> 40:38.049
Where are Korn and the others?

442
40:41.928 --> 40:44.500
I asked you where the hell they are!

443
40:45.992 --> 40:47.250
I don't know, Master Tim.

444
40:47.704 --> 40:49.700
I thought you'd already taken them out.

445
40:50.254 --> 40:52.900
Check the CCTV footage! Find out who took them!

446
41:00.443 --> 41:01.520
Go! Get in the car!

447
41:04.166 --> 41:05.480
Hurry!

448
41:12.515 --> 41:15.640
- Hey! Uncle! Dad! - Hattha, calm down! Calm down!

449
41:26.635 --> 41:27.636
Where the hell have you been?

450
41:31.369 --> 41:33.370
Where have you been?

451
41:34.280 --> 41:35.840
Let me go, Master Tim.

452
41:37.960 --> 41:40.280
I just want to live a normal life.

453
41:41.039 --> 41:42.040
Your life

454
41:44.115 --> 41:45.320
belongs to me.

455
41:47.712 --> 41:48.880
Have you forgotten that?

456
41:54.182 --> 41:55.183
Come here!

457
41:57.539 --> 41:59.640
Master Tim, you're hurting me!

458
42:06.200 --> 42:09.320
Stop being such a psycho, Master Tim! Muk said no, and she means it!

459
42:09.750 --> 42:10.751
Go!

460
42:26.886 --> 42:29.250
There's no way you can overpower those bodyguards.

461
42:29.843 --> 42:32.640
Your only chance is precision.

462
42:37.843 --> 42:40.570
Apply steady pressure to cut off blood flow to the brain.

463
42:41.336 --> 42:42.520
The body will shut down,

464
42:43.219 --> 42:44.800
and they'll quietly lose consciousness.

465
42:53.326 --> 42:54.840
Muk! Muk, hurry!

466
42:59.390 --> 43:00.391
But remember,

467
43:00.720 --> 43:01.760
you have to keep your fingers steady.

468
43:02.547 --> 43:04.320
If your hand shakes or you miss even slightly,

469
43:05.150 --> 43:06.920
they'll turn around and attack you immediately.

470
43:47.862 --> 43:50.560
Wan, I'm following the car that took our father.

471
43:51.054 --> 43:54.040
Master Tim struck Muk in the back with his cane.

472
43:54.179 --> 43:55.180
She's probably having trouble breathing.

473
43:55.315 --> 43:56.700
How is Muk doing?

474
43:57.086 --> 43:58.387
Is Muk okay?

475
43:58.960 --> 44:02.200
I'm okay. I'm just a little winded.

476
44:03.064 --> 44:04.065
Then...

477
44:04.734 --> 44:06.000
Wan, take Muk home.

478
44:06.200 --> 44:08.760
And gently massage her neck and shoulders along the way.

479
44:08.899 --> 44:10.700
But don't press randomly. Let Muk guide you to the right spots.

480
44:10.987 --> 44:14.560
And Muk, gently press the points below your collarbones from time to time.

481
44:14.582 --> 44:16.250
I'll come as soon as I've rescued my father.

482
44:16.683 --> 44:18.040
Okay, I will.

483
44:18.560 --> 44:19.561
Okay, Hattha.

484
44:48.438 --> 44:49.439
Hey, hurry up!

485
44:55.963 --> 44:56.964
Go!

486
44:59.462 --> 45:00.463
Go!

487
45:10.912 --> 45:11.913
That's strange.

488
45:12.363 --> 45:15.564
These are my father's men who were sent to infiltrate Arokaya.

489
45:16.582 --> 45:18.100
Why are they involved with your fathers?

490
45:19.184 --> 45:21.840
- I don't care who they are. I'm saving my father! - Wait!

491
45:41.891 --> 45:42.892
Let go!

492
45:55.000 --> 45:56.001
In, are you okay?

493
45:56.886 --> 45:58.200
I'm okay. How about you?

494
46:06.240 --> 46:07.241
Mr. Krit!

495
46:22.038 --> 46:23.039
Dad!

496
46:23.920 --> 46:25.721
I thought you'd died back then.

497
46:29.707 --> 46:30.880
You've got quite a capable daughter.

498
46:31.500 --> 46:32.801
You've met Hattha before?

499
46:33.192 --> 46:34.193
Of course.

500
46:35.240 --> 46:36.241
Many times, in fact.

501
46:40.451 --> 46:41.452
- Dad! - Wait!

502
46:42.062 --> 46:43.063
Dad!

503
46:43.123 --> 46:44.360
- Hattha! - Hattha!

504
46:46.900 --> 46:47.901
Dad!

505
46:48.376 --> 46:49.800
He's the flatfoot bastard who killed Mom!

506
46:52.150 --> 46:53.151
The flatfoot bastard?

507
46:59.014 --> 47:00.015
Is that true, sir?

508
47:17.304 --> 47:18.840
You killed my son too, didn't you?

509
47:24.696 --> 47:27.600
Your son was hired to be a scapegoat.

510
47:29.979 --> 47:31.980
I just helped him finish the job.

511
47:35.155 --> 47:36.640
You're a fucking monster!

512
47:37.550 --> 47:38.551
Hattha, watch out!

513
47:39.982 --> 47:40.983
Hattha!

514
47:43.376 --> 47:44.377
Hattha!

515
47:48.283 --> 47:49.760
The boss ordered us to kill everyone.

516
48:25.147 --> 48:26.440
Go! Hurry!

517
48:27.800 --> 48:28.801
Hurry!

518
48:30.614 --> 48:31.720
- Go! - Phat!

519
48:31.872 --> 48:32.873
Hurry!

520
48:33.200 --> 48:34.201
Phat!

521
48:42.000 --> 48:43.001
Hey…

522
48:43.230 --> 48:44.231
The knife!

523
48:52.987 --> 48:53.988
Come on, let me help.

524
49:00.760 --> 49:02.400
- Wait! The wheel's come off! - What?

525
49:04.104 --> 49:06.400
Leave it! We'll never escape in this thing! Go!

526
49:06.968 --> 49:07.969
Keep quiet.

527
49:08.931 --> 49:10.130
Uncle, let's rest here for a bit.

528
49:18.067 --> 49:21.200
Doctor, my car's over there. The keys are in my pocket.

529
49:28.910 --> 49:31.520
Being around those bastards has made your life a living hell!

530
49:31.680 --> 49:33.240
You have to kill those bastards! Let me go!

531
49:34.700 --> 49:37.300
From now on, I won't blindly follow your orders if they don't make sense.

532
49:37.456 --> 49:39.057
What the fuck do you mean, they don't make sense?

533
49:39.240 --> 49:41.360
If those bastards are still alive, I'll never become party leader!

534
49:41.742 --> 49:44.600
Then I guess you're out of luck. You've got plenty more dirty secrets to hide.

535
49:44.697 --> 49:47.720
I've kept them hidden all this time. And today, I'll get rid of you all, too.

536
49:48.432 --> 49:49.817
Please let them go, Dad.

537
49:50.200 --> 49:51.320
Just let them go.

538
49:54.848 --> 49:56.315
So now you dare defy my orders?

539
49:59.510 --> 50:00.960
I just don't want you to do anything wrong again.

540
50:01.243 --> 50:02.244
What the fuck is wrong with that?

541
50:03.317 --> 50:04.800
Letting those bastards live would be the real mistake!

542
50:07.190 --> 50:09.302
You're just as fucking useless as your mother!

543
50:13.467 --> 50:14.600
Leave Mom out of this!

544
50:16.822 --> 50:18.280
Your mother was the worst of them all!

545
50:19.744 --> 50:20.960
But I really have to thank you.

546
50:21.248 --> 50:22.960
If you hadn't run away from home that night,

547
50:23.579 --> 50:26.140
I wouldn't have known where your mother's brakes would fail.

548
50:42.539 --> 50:43.560
Mom's brakes failed?

549
50:52.720 --> 50:53.960
Did you do that?

550
51:05.051 --> 51:06.052
Why?

551
51:08.016 --> 51:09.440
Why did you have to kill Mom?

552
51:13.752 --> 51:17.440
Because she was going to betray me, just like you're doing now!

553
51:19.651 --> 51:21.400
That bitch demanded I leave my wife.

554
51:22.000 --> 51:23.601
Or she'd expose me for taking bribes.

555
51:25.278 --> 51:26.360
Can you believe that shit?

556
51:29.368 --> 51:30.800
She fucking deserved to die!

557
51:38.651 --> 51:40.720
What the fuck is taking them so long?

558
51:44.771 --> 51:46.440
Did you ever love Mom and me?

559
51:57.563 --> 51:59.080
Whether I love you or not doesn't matter.

560
52:00.784 --> 52:02.400
But your mother loved you very much.

561
52:06.747 --> 52:09.520
And thanks to you, I managed to get rid of her, you little bastard!

562
52:18.432 --> 52:19.926
If you're going to shoot me, do it!

563
52:20.768 --> 52:21.769
Go ahead! Shoot me!

564
52:35.448 --> 52:36.640
- You bastard! - Phat!

565
52:46.678 --> 52:47.680
You're the real bastard!

566
52:48.472 --> 52:50.080
I'm lucky I don't have a father like you!

567
52:50.766 --> 52:52.240
You don't want me to shoot Phat?

568
52:52.920 --> 52:54.520
Then I'll shoot your father first!

569
52:57.334 --> 52:58.335
Hattha, don't!

570
53:05.656 --> 53:08.083
Is this that bullshit deadly massage technique of yours?

571
53:16.190 --> 53:17.191
Hattha!

572
53:17.619 --> 53:19.000
Go get the gun, Minkheng!

573
53:20.467 --> 53:21.920
Where are you going? Where the hell are you going?

574
53:26.790 --> 53:27.791
You little shit!

575
53:29.904 --> 53:31.360
Hattha, press his neck!

576
53:31.515 --> 53:32.516
Press his neck!

577
53:36.382 --> 53:37.383
Harder!

578
53:40.150 --> 53:41.200
Harder! Put more pressure on it!

579
53:41.798 --> 53:42.799
Good!

580
53:42.968 --> 53:45.480
Phat, help me!

581
53:45.700 --> 53:46.701
Hattha!

582
53:47.701 --> 53:48.802
I was just trying to stop him.

583
53:59.494 --> 54:00.495
You little bitch!

584
54:31.378 --> 54:32.379
Drop your weapons!

585
54:39.598 --> 54:41.700
Inn, we're safe now.

586
54:42.696 --> 54:43.697
The police are here.

587
54:46.254 --> 54:47.255
Shit!

588
54:54.200 --> 54:55.201
Hey.

589
55:03.779 --> 55:06.840
Master Tim reported that you deliberately caused a disturbance

590
55:07.200 --> 55:09.100
and damaged Arokaya's property.

591
55:09.290 --> 55:10.720
You'd better surrender peacefully.

592
55:11.275 --> 55:14.360
We're the ones Master Tim held captive!

593
55:14.832 --> 55:16.500
Master Tim is the one who should be arrested!

594
55:17.317 --> 55:18.520
Don't be stubborn, Inn.

595
55:19.990 --> 55:21.920
They came all this way to ask you nicely.

596
55:23.392 --> 55:25.120
So you'd better go quietly.

597
55:26.832 --> 55:28.040
Let's not make things difficult for everyone.

598
55:28.950 --> 55:31.760
And these are the cops we're supposed to rely on?

599
55:32.619 --> 55:33.880
You're nothing but thugs in uniform!

600
55:34.640 --> 55:35.641
You little shit!

601
55:37.238 --> 55:38.239
Let go!

602
55:39.814 --> 55:40.840
Let me go! Let go!

603
55:41.046 --> 55:42.047
Come here!

604
55:46.539 --> 55:48.560
So, you think you're good at massage, huh?

605
55:49.515 --> 55:50.516
Don't!

606
55:53.344 --> 55:57.560
Stay still! Mind your own fucking business, you little bastard!

607
55:58.758 --> 56:00.400
What about this side? This one too, right?

608
56:03.798 --> 56:04.810
That's enough!

609
56:06.758 --> 56:10.520
I told you not to touch Korn or his daughter yet!

610
56:13.739 --> 56:15.200
You still haven't given up, Master Tim?

611
56:15.392 --> 56:18.800
What's with your obsession with that ridiculous deadly massage technique?

612
56:20.278 --> 56:22.960
It's fucking absurd!

613
56:29.422 --> 56:30.423
Hey!

614
56:31.112 --> 56:33.250
I think it's time to end this, massage therapist.

615
56:51.438 --> 56:52.439
Dad!

616
56:59.859 --> 57:00.860
Dad!

617
57:03.670 --> 57:04.671
Dad!

618
57:05.032 --> 57:06.033
Dad!

619
57:06.035 --> 57:07.036
